WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.530
Welcome and your practical destination A professional executive partnership makes

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:09.585
work clear and commitments reliable In this unit you will

00:00:09.585 --> 00:00:15.505
translate priorities into support deliverables prepare a usable working agreement

00:00:15.505 --> 00:00:20.865
distinguish role boundaries present options when demands conflict and arrange

00:00:20.865 --> 00:00:24.940
a concern route and sustainable cover Your two main work

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:29.500
products are a working agreement and a priority decision brief

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:34.335
The Meridian people and arrangements are fictional Numerical examples are

00:00:34.335 --> 00:00:39.750
case facts not operating standards The course does not grant

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:45.160
workplace authority Start with the introduction video then continue to

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:47.240
the first reflection
